339	/**
340	 * Port of `whoosh.analysis.tokenizers.IDTokenizer`.
341	 *
342	 * Yields the ENTIRE value as exactly one token, verbatim: spaces preserved, case
343	 * preserved, no stop-word removal, no minsize filtering. This is the whole point
344	 * of the `ID` field type - "the quick brown fox" becomes the single term
345	 * "the quick brown fox", so `ID:quick` matches nothing.
